## 2026-08-22 — Whole-container ECC framing (format v2.1 candidate)
F5.extractContainer parses header/metadata BEFORE Reed-Solomon recovery;
ErrorCorrection currently covers only the payload. Corrupted coefficients that
cascade through F5 matrix encoding can therefore kill metadata parsing
(JSON parse failures) even when the RS budget would have absorbed them.
Required redesign: two-layer framing (RS-coded fixed header carrying
eccProfile/lengths + RS-coded body), capacity-math update, and migration of
hand-crafted container tests. Tracked from vault-e2e-ecc skip note.
